# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 检出时 CRLF/LF 混用
# （此前 database.js、analysis.js 等文件被编辑器转成 CRLF，git 操作持续产生行尾警告）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.rds binary
